# Binary Block — Phase 3 (v1)

Read `docs/binary-block/PHASES.md`. **Current phase: 3.**

## Phase 3 v1 scope

Luna on **clear screen only** — dynamic import, WebP spritesheet loaded on clear:

- `sit` · `tail_wag` · `bark` animations synced to clear phases
- Module: `games/binary-mosaic/ui/LunaClearCompanion.tsx`
- Shared assets: `engine/luna/*`, `public/characters/luna/spritesheet.webp`

## Forbidden (Phase 3 v1)

Top-page Luna · in-play idle Luna · level-select Luna · Firebase · ranking · new animation libraries · huge images

## Do not change

Phase 1 puzzle logic · Phase 2 `localStorage` save · level data · clear SE/BGM logic

## Capacity

- Luna JS + WebP must not load on initial game entry — only when clear starts
- Use `dynamic import` for Luna companion chunk
- No new npm dependencies
